cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts in academic work, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "Tuned Mass Damper Vibration Analysis"
authors:
  - family-names: "Úcar Gargallo"
    given-names: "Pablo"
abstract: >-
  Python post-processing tools for PULSE acceleration spectra and Tracker
  time-domain acceleration exports, developed in the context of an experimental
  undergraduate thesis on a mass-spring tuned mass damper.
keywords:
  - tuned mass damper
  - vibration analysis
  - acceleration
  - FFT
  - PULSE
  - Tracker
